WEBVTT

00:03:58.602 --> 00:04:00.504
just because it's cheaper.

00:04:01.705 --> 00:04:05.142
Between 2017 and 2019,

00:04:05.175 --> 00:04:10.814
14 type 1 diabetics
were identified as dying

00:04:10.847 --> 00:04:13.483
from diabetic ketoacidosis,

00:04:13.517 --> 00:04:16.253
a deadly complication of high blood sugar,

00:04:16.253 --> 00:04:18.522
also known as DKA,

00:04:18.555 --> 00:04:20.590
due to insulin rationing.

00:04:21.591 --> 00:04:23.627
I want to take a moment for them.

00:04:25.996 --> 00:04:27.397
Monique Moses.

00:04:29.132 --> 00:04:30.400
Shane Boyle.